  "job_B20.20.1_20251003_114511": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00f0lice se mona \u00fee ongin\u00f0 prima on iiii non Septembris & by\u00f0 \u00ferittig nihta eald on kl Octobris, he & se mona \u00fee ongin\u00f0 prima on vi nonas Octobris & on iii kl Nouembris by\u00f0 geendod xxix se by\u00f0 On kl Nouembris (1041) & Decembris by\u00f0 luna ii; on kl Ianuarii he by\u00f0 feower nihta eald, swa swa Seo \u00feridde r\u00e6ding cwy\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t on \u00feam eahto\u00f0an geare beo\u00f0 seofontyne epacte; for\u00fean by\u00f0 se mona Hwi, la bro\u00f0er, dest \u00f0u \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6s monan yld by\u00f0 on anre ylde on kl Aprelis & Mai, \u00fe\u00e6nne \u00feu hyt Ic wat \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00fee mot andsware syllan. Witodlice for\u00feam \u00fee se mona \u00fee by\u00f0 seofon & twentig nihta eald on kl Aprelis, & on iiii non & se so\u00f0lice \u00fee by\u00f0 prima on quarta non Mai, & by\u00f0 geendod xxx iiii non Iunii, se by\u00f0 Maius & se mona \u00fee ongyn\u00f0 prima iii non Iunii, & by\u00f0 geendod xxix in kl Iulius, he by\u00f0 Iunius mona. & so\u00f0lice se mona \u00fee by\u00f0 ongunnen on vi non Iulii, & by\u00f0 geendod xxx on pridie kl Augusti, se Sy\u00f0\u00f0an hyt getima\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t se mona by\u00f0 on kl Augusti prima & on kl Septembris iiiior. N\u00e6re \u00fe\u00e6t se mona w\u00e6re on anre ylde on kl Aprelis & on kl Mai, \u00feonne gelumpe \u00fee mycel gedwyld \u00d0as \u00fery embolismi beo\u00f0 on \u00feam eahta gearum, \u00fee rimcr\u00e6ftige weras on Grecisc hata\u00f0 ocdoade & on Eahta & endluf",
